# Fly.io secret template for agentclip-web.
#
# `op` resolves the op://... references at deploy time; the values
# never appear in git. To deploy new secret values, edit them in
# 1Password (vault: Personal, item: agentclip), then run:
#
#   bin/sync-secrets.sh web
#
# The web frontend has no real secrets at v0.1 — it's a public
# client. This file exists so the deploy contract is symmetric and
# future additions (Sentry DSN, analytics tokens, etc.) have a home.

# Placeholder so `fly secrets import` accepts the file even when the
# real list is empty. Remove once a real secret is added.
WEB_DEPLOY_PLACEHOLDER={{ op://Personal/agentclip/WEB_DEPLOY_PLACEHOLDER }}
